<title>HONG KONG: Hutchison Port to develop Indonesian port.</title>
<headline>Hutchison Port to develop Indonesian port.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchison Port Holdings, a wholly owned subsidiary of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd, said on Wednesday it has signed a joint venture agreement to develop Indonesia's Bojonegara deep sea port.</p>
</text>
